  "limitations": [
    "Retrospective membership and downloaded prices do not establish point-in-time availability. Later revisions may affect values. Nine specified predictors enter the primary model; other indicators are supplementary descriptive context.",
    "Mapping evidence and approval bounds are retrospective assumptions; unresolved identities and dates remain unavailable.",
    "Missing acquired/delisted histories and uneven mapping evidence select the evaluated population; results do not generalize to all members.",
    "Monthly 30-day windows can count one event twice and miss other events. Repeated securities and clustered removals are dependent observations.",
    "Observed-session windows retain dated invalid rows; entirely absent interior sessions remain a separate ingestion coverage limitation.",
    "Removal probabilities are distinct from descriptive momentum ranks.",
    "Feature selection followed repeated inspection of this historical test period. Matched-cohort comparisons are exploratory and do not establish independent predictive improvement. Rare removals make small Brier scores possible even for a weak constant baseline.",
    "The selected 0.05 classification cutoff is exploratory; performance on unseen data remains unverified."
  ],
